	"faq": {
		"title": "FAQ",
		"questions": {
			"q1": "How to edit personal profile?",
			"a1": "You can click on your avatar on the \"Mine\" page to enter the profile page, then click the \"Edit\" button in the top right corner to modify your profile, including avatar, nickname, gender, birthday and other information.",
			"q2": "How to add friends?",
			"a2": "You can add friends in the following ways: 1. Click the \"+\" icon in the top right corner of the \"Messages\" page and select \"Add Friends\";  2. Browse recommended users on the \"Discover\" page and send friend requests; 3. Add through phone number or username search.",
			"q3": "What to do if I forget my password?",
			"a3": "If you forget your login password, you can click \"Forgot Password\" on the login page, and then reset your password through the phone verification code. If you don't have a bound phone number, you can retrieve your account through customer service appeal.",
			"q4": "How to delete account?",
			"a4": "You can apply to delete your account in \"Settings\"->\"Account & Security\"->\"Delete Account\". Please note that account deletion is irreversible and will delete all your data. Please proceed with caution.",
			"q5": "How to contact customer service?",
			"a5": "You can contact customer service in the following ways: 1. Contact online customer service in \"Settings\"->\"Help\"->\"Customer Service & Support\"; 2. Call customer service hotline: 400-123-4567 (working hours: 9:00-21:00); 3. Initiate a new service through the \"Customer Service Center\" page."
		}
	},
